3.0 a gremlin once stole my fire protection. AAARRRGGGHHH! (Needless
to say, I was in hell) Then this freakish bug occured: I had an AOLS,
the gremlin stole my fire intrinsic and I promptly died, the medallion
vanished and there I was, safe and sound again (I thought, at
least...). As I wasn't quite sure why I had died (you're not told that
a gremling steals an intrinsic), I just applied my WoW to get me a new
AOLS. As I was wearing speed boot, I managed to put the amulet on
before another fire intrinsic check. When the program then checked,
yet another medallion vanished, I died and so did the program, giving
me some freakish message about what code segment to examine for
bugs...

